{
  "title": "NTR-Neel film: Star actor to begin filming with an explosive action sequence",
  "publication_date": "2025-04-17T04:30:38+00:00",
  "summary": "Jr. NTR will start filming Prashanth Neel\u2019s new action project from April 22 with a large-scale explosive fight sequence that runs through May 15. The film, reportedly titled Dragon, is produced by Mythri Movie Makers and NTR Arts. Kannada actor Rukmini Vasanth is a frontrunner for the female lead, with Ravi Basrur composing. NTR is also finalising War 2, which stars Hrithik Roshan.",
  "content": "Star actor Jr. NTR is busy giving the final touches to War 2, which also stars Hrithik Roshan. The film is set for a grand release during the Independence Day weekend, clashing with Rajinikanth\u2019s Coolie. NTR will begin filming for Prashanth Neel\u2019s project from April 22.\\n\\nNTR will start shooting for an explosive action sequence from the said date, and the director is said to have designed it on a massive scale involving many junior artists. The schedule will go on till May 15, and this fight is reportedly one of the biggest attractions of the big-ticket entertainer.\\n\\nDragon is the title in consideration for this flick. Kannada beauty Rukmini Vasanth is the front-runner to play the leading lady. The biggie is being bankrolled jointly by Mythri Movie Makers and NTR Arts. Ravi Basrur is roped in to compose the tunes.",
