  "markdown_content": "## Overview\\n\\nStar actor Jr. NTR is busy giving the final touches to War 2, which also stars Hrithik Roshan. The film is set for a grand release during the Independence Day weekend, clashing with Rajinikanth\u2019s Coolie. NTR will begin filming for Prashanth Neel\u2019s project from April 22.\\n\\n## Shooting Schedule and Action Sequence\\n\\nNTR will start shooting for an explosive action sequence from the said date, and the director is said to have designed it on a massive scale involving many junior artists. The schedule will go on till May 15, and this fight is reportedly one of the biggest attractions of the big-ticket entertainer.\\n\\n## Title, Cast and Crew\\n\\n- Dragon is the title in consideration for this flick.\\n- Kannada beauty Rukmini Vasanth is the front-runner to play the leading lady.\\n- The biggie is being bankrolled jointly by Mythri Movie Makers and NTR Arts.\\n- Ravi Basrur is roped in to compose the tunes.",
